@startuml SCRUM-69-use-case
title SCRUM-69 Admin: Manage Users (listing 22)
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Admin\n(seeded or promoted)" as Admin
actor "Visitor / non-admin" as Other

rectangle "Sakan Admin Module" {
  usecase "UC-22.1\nList and filter users" as UC1
  usecase "UC-22.2\nGrant role (promote)" as UC2
  usecase "UC-22.3\nRevoke role (demote)" as UC3
  usecase "Sign in as admin\n(SCRUM-61)" as SignIn
  usecase "Verify caller is still\nan enabled admin in DB" as Verify
  usecase "Check protection rules" as Rules
  usecase "Reject: seeded admin,\nself-demote, last admin,\nno roles left" as Reject
}

Admin --> UC1
Admin --> UC2
Admin --> UC3

UC1 ..> SignIn : <<include>>
UC2 ..> SignIn : <<include>>
UC3 ..> SignIn : <<include>>
UC1 ..> Verify : <<include>>
UC2 ..> Verify : <<include>>
UC3 ..> Verify : <<include>>
UC3 ..> Rules : <<include>>
Reject ..> UC3 : <<extend>>

Other --> UC1 : 401 / 403
note right of Other
  Non-admin or signed-out callers
  are rejected on every admin endpoint
end note
@enduml
